Move-Item <解压出来的 dsh-tide-memory> "$env:USERPROFILE\.dsh\plugins\dsh-tide-memory"
```

**2. 让 profile 认到这个插件**

编辑 `<DSH_HOME>\profiles\<你的profile>\package.json`（通常是 `profiles\desktop\package.json`）：jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    // 加这一行：link: 后面写你上一步的实际绝对路径
    "dsh-tide-memory": "link:<插件目录>"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        // 数组末尾加这一行
        "dsh-tide-memory"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

**3. 同步依赖树**（在 profile 目录下执行，`pnpm` 用 DSH 自带的即可）

```powershell
pnpm install
```

Edit `<DSH_HOME>\profiles\<your-profile>\package.json` (usually `profiles\desktop\package.json`):jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    // add this line: the path after link: is the absolute path from step 1
    "dsh-tide-memory": "link:<plugin-dir>"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        // add this line to the end of the array
        "dsh-tide-memory"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
